    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like there's nothing left. i look at my desk, at all these halffinished things, and i just feel... empty. like the person who wrote those words actually died a long time ago and i'm just the ghost left behind. it's not even a block anymore. it's just a void. i'm just taking up space that could belong to someone who actually has something to say.",
